From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Felipe Paiva <felipe.paiva@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 11:11:40 +0400
Subject: [PATCH] tg16-input

The TurboGrafx-16 pad: B is II, A is I, START is Run and SELECT reaches
the game after slot's chord hold, so Select and Run together are the
console's own soft reset, which stays on. X and Y are the pad's turbo
switches: they reach slot as raw buttons on TG16 alone, and slot's
Turbo Buttons setting pulses I on X and II on Y, or sends nothing when
it is off; the core's own turbo stays off. L1 and R1 stay slot's
picture keys.

The layout follows nelynes/slotPlus 92b7022 (GPL-3.0).
---
